  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "企業責任與全球永續",
    "sub_ename": "CORPORATE RESPONSIBILITY AND GLOBAL SUSTAINABILITY",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在探索企業在全球永續發展中的關鍵角色。隨著氣候變遷的加劇，企業面臨實現淨零排放和社會共享目標的挑戰。透過深入分析各種企業個案，以及互動教學形式，本課程將激發學生認識到企業責任對全球永續發展的關鍵影響，並提供實用策略以應對當前和未來的挑戰。",
    "describe_eh": "This course explores the key role of business in global sustainable development. As climate change intensifies, businesses are challenged to achieve net-zero emissions and shared goals for society. Through in-depth analysis of various corporate cases and interactive teaching formats, this course will inspire students to recognize the critical impact of corporate responsibility on global sustainable development and provide practical strategies to deal with current and future challenges.",
